### Adding Additional Header Fields

1. **Extend AVARUMCashInvoiceTmpHeader table**:
```xml
<AxTableField xmlns="" i:type="AxTableFieldString">
    <Name>NewField</Name>
    <ExtendedDataType>YourEDT</ExtendedDataType>
</AxTableField>
```

2. **Update AVARUMCashInvoiceDP.populateHeaderData()**:
```csharp
tmpHeader.NewField = cashSalesVoucher.NewField;
```

3. **Update Report Dataset** in AxReport/AVARUMCashInvoice.xml:
```xml
<AxReportDataSetField>
    <Name>NewField</Name>
