## 🐛 Troubleshooting

### Report Not Found
- Verify all files are in correct locations
- Rebuild the model
- Synchronize database
- Redeploy reports using Publish-AXReport

### Lookup Not Working
- Check AVARUMCashInvoiceUIBuilder is properly linked in contract
- Verify SysOperationContractProcessingAttribute is set
- Check that AVARUMCashSalesCashVoucher table exists

### No Data Displayed
- Verify cash voucher exists in AVARUMCashSalesCashVoucher
- Check SalesLine records have AVARUMCashVoucher populated
- Debug AVARUMCashInvoiceDP.processReport() method

### Company Information Missing
- Verify CompanyInfo has data for current company
- Check LogisticsPostalAddress is linked to company
- Verify LogisticsElectronicAddress exists with Phone type

### Performance Issues
- Add indexes to AVARUMCashVoucher field on SalesLine
- Consider caching company information
- Optimize queries in populateLinesData()

